### Services
GET http://localhost:8000/services

### Create service (admin bearer token required)
POST http://localhost:8000/services
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN

{"name":"Consultation", "description":"30 minute meeting"}

### Create future slot (replace time with a future 30-minute UTC time)
POST http://localhost:8000/services/1/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN

{"starts_at":"2030-01-01T10:00:00Z"}

### Book slot (customer bearer token required)
POST http://localhost:8000/bookings
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: booking-abc-12345
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot_id":1}
